{{!
    @template block_dash/picker_detail

    Right column of the pickers: what the selected option is, with a live preview of gallery items.
    On narrow screens it replaces the list, with a button back to it.

    Blocks:
    * hint - Text shown before anything is selected.

    Example context (json):
    {}
}}
<div class="col-md-8 col-xl-9" data-region="picker-detail">
    <button type="button" class="btn btn-link px-0 mb-2 d-md-none" data-action="picker-back">
        {{#pix}} i/previous, core {{/pix}}{{#str}} back {{/str}}
    </button>
    <p class="text-muted" data-gallery-description></p>
    <div class="block-dash-gallery-preview" data-gallery-preview>
        <p class="text-muted">{{$hint}}{{/hint}}</p>
    </div>
</div>
